  "goodToKnow": "Die Tournee is a tour by musicians, actors or other performers: auf Tournee gehen, die Abschiedstournee (farewell tour). It comes from French tournée and is stressed on the last syllable. For a sightseeing tour, Germans say die Tour, die Rundfahrt or die Führung (guided tour). German bands like Rammstein and Die Toten Hosen play huge stadium Tourneen. Plural: die Tourneen."
